1
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:06,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ichiraku Ramen</font>

2
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:10,480
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. Ichiraku hasn't changed a bit!</font>

3
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:15,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">Mm... This aroma...
It's whetting my appetite.</font>

4
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:17,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right!</font>

5
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:21,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hiya!</font>

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:23,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">Welcome!</font>

7
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:28,280
<font color="#FFFFFF">Old man... Do you remember me?</font>

8
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:30,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto...</font>

9
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:31,780
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's you, isn't it, Naruto?</font>

10
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:34,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">No way could I forget you!</font>

11
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:35,780
<font color="#FFFFFF">Long time no see!</font>

12
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:37,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh? Naruto?</font>

13
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:39,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">You sure got big!</font>

14
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:41,580
<font color="#FFFFFF">Long time no see, miss!</font>

15
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:44,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">What'll you have?
You're hungry, right?</font>

16
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:46,380
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah, I'm starved!</font>

17
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:49,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right then, today it's on me.</font>

18
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:50,980
<font color="#FFFFFF">Order whatever you like!</font>

19
00:00:51,150 --> 00:00:52,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right!</font>

20
00:00:52,250 --> 00:00:53,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">No...</font>

21
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:55,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's on me today.</font>

22
00:00:57,880 --> 00:01:00,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">I knew you'd be here, Naruto!</font>

23
00:01:00,420 --> 00:01:01,550
<font color="#FFFFFF">Iruka Sensei!</font>

24
00:01:02,350 --> 00:01:04,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sakura isn't with you?</font>

25
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:12,980
<font color="#FFFFFF">If I'd known you were going to treat,
I'd have brought Sakura, too...</font>

26
00:01:22,780 --> 00:01:27,580
<font color="#FFFFFF">Maybe I should've let him
treat me to half a ramen.</font>

27
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:33,780
<font color="#FFFFFF">Can I get some
more rice-flour anmitsu?</font>

28
00:01:34,580 --> 00:01:35,480
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh!</font>

29
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:30,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wh-What's this?</font>

30
00:02:30,980 --> 00:02:32,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's Lord Kazekage's sand...!</font>

31
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:36,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wow! Look at the size
of the shield he made!</font>

32
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:40,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just what I'd expect from the Kazekage.</font>

33
00:02:43,380 --> 00:02:44,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara...</font>

34
00:03:00,650 --> 00:03:02,650
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay, you're within...</font>

35
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:07,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">range!</font>

36
00:03:09,920 --> 00:03:10,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara!</font>

37
00:04:43,250 --> 00:04:47,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">Mission Cleared</font>

38
00:04:58,980 --> 00:05:00,880
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay, you're within...</font>

39
00:05:05,150 --> 00:05:06,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">range!</font>

40
00:05:08,150 --> 00:05:09,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara!</font>

41
00:05:10,620 --> 00:05:11,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">Fifth Kazekage!</font>

42
00:05:33,650 --> 00:05:34,880
<font color="#FFFFFF">I wonder if he's okay...</font>

43
00:05:35,050 --> 00:05:37,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">He did it!
You're amazing, Lord Kazekage.</font>

44
00:05:37,780 --> 00:05:38,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ooh!</font>

45
00:05:40,150 --> 00:05:43,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara's Total Sand Defense
can't be broken that easily.</font>

46
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:46,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lord Baki! The preparations for attack
have been completed!</font>

47
00:05:47,150 --> 00:05:50,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right! Attack all together
when I give the signal!</font>

48
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:10,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'd expect no less...</font>

49
00:06:10,880 --> 00:06:13,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">His specially-created sand sure
got some quick defense...</font>

50
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">However...</font>

51
00:06:32,350 --> 00:06:34,380
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's just what I want.</font>

52
00:06:53,050 --> 00:06:54,980
<font color="#FFFFFF">My left hand was crushed...</font>

53
00:07:07,620 --> 00:07:08,880
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sand Coffin.</font>

54
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:12,580
<font color="#FFFFFF">However, I used that opportunity
to eat some of your sand...</font>

55
00:07:12,620 --> 00:07:15,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">and mix it with my bomb clay.</font>

56
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:21,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">You were doomed the instant you used
that sand to defend yourself.</font>

57
00:07:22,580 --> 00:07:26,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">That being said,
I planned it that way!</font>

58
00:07:31,650 --> 00:07:32,950
<font color="#FFFFFF">Art...</font>

59
00:07:33,420 --> 00:07:35,380
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Oh, no...
- ... is explosive!</font>

60
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:41,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">Here's an extra-large special serving
of our ramen!</font>

61
00:07:44,650 --> 00:07:47,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's the real-deal Ichiraku ramen...</font>

62
00:07:48,980 --> 00:07:53,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">I dreamed about this ramen
so many times during my training...</font>

63
00:07:54,020 --> 00:07:56,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now, eat up before it gets cold!</font>

64
00:07:56,380 --> 00:07:57,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right.</font>

65
00:07:59,780 --> 00:08:00,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">Thank you!</font>

66
00:08:05,350 --> 00:08:07,950
<font color="#FFFFFF">By the way,
can I ask you a favor, Sensei?</font>

67
00:08:08,450 --> 00:08:09,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">You want seconds?</font>

68
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:13,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let me wear your Leaf Headband.</font>

69
00:08:14,020 --> 00:08:17,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, this? No way.</font>

70
00:08:17,580 --> 00:08:19,480
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is proof that you've graduated
from the Academy</font>

71
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:22,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">and have been acknowledged
as a full-fledged Ninja, you see!</font>

72
00:08:22,980 --> 00:08:24,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wait for yours until tomorrow!</font>

73
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:26,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">You cheapskate!</font>

74
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:35,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Naruto...
- Huh?</font>

75
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:37,950
<font color="#FFFFFF">You've sure grown
a lot compared to the time</font>

76
00:08:37,980 --> 00:08:40,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">when you wanted this...</font>

77
00:08:40,850 --> 00:08:43,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">Have I? Have I?
Do you think so?</font>

78
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:46,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">This Headband you gave me,</font>

79
00:08:46,350 --> 00:08:48,880
<font color="#FFFFFF">it looks perfect on me now, doesn't it?</font>

80
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:55,650
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't be getting carried away!
You've still got a long way to go.</font>

81
00:08:56,050 --> 00:08:58,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">You've still got to do better and better!</font>

82
00:09:00,550 --> 00:09:02,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">You've gotten so big...</font>

83
00:09:04,180 --> 00:09:06,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">Man, this is good!</font>

84
00:09:06,420 --> 00:09:09,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sure enough, Ichiraku Ramen
is the greatest!</font>

85
00:09:11,950 --> 00:09:13,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">Isn't it, though?</font>

86
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">But...</font>

87
00:09:15,180 --> 00:09:16,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hm?</font>

88
00:09:16,420 --> 00:09:18,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's one thing
I'm not quite happy with.</font>

89
00:09:19,980 --> 00:09:23,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto... We meet for
the first time in ages</font>

90
00:09:23,380 --> 00:09:27,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">and the first thing you do is find fault
with my ramen? Huh?</font>

91
00:09:27,020 --> 00:09:29,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's... It's not like that.</font>

92
00:09:29,250 --> 00:09:31,480
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't have a problem
with the ramen.</font>

93
00:09:31,550 --> 00:09:32,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then what is it?</font>

94
00:09:34,250 --> 00:09:39,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">I... thought the next time Iruka Sensei
would treat me to ramen</font>

95
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:41,880
<font color="#FFFFFF">would be after I'd become a Chunin...</font>

96
00:09:43,550 --> 00:09:44,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto...</font>

97
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:48,880
<font color="#FFFFFF">All of my classmates have
become Chunin,</font>

98
00:09:49,450 --> 00:09:52,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">and I'm the only one
who's still just a Genin.</font>

99
00:09:54,750 --> 00:09:57,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">You don't need to worry about
whether you're a Genin or a Chunin.</font>

100
00:09:57,950 --> 00:10:01,780
<font color="#FFFFFF">After all, Master Jiraiya
trained you personally...</font>

101
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:03,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know, but...</font>

102
00:10:03,850 --> 00:10:07,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">But listen, that Pervy Sage
is really merciless!</font>

103
00:10:08,420 --> 00:10:14,480
<font color="#FFFFFF">The cloth on the precious Headband
you gave me got all tattered.</font>

104
00:10:14,650 --> 00:10:16,550
<font color="#FFFFFF">The same with my clothes, too.</font>

105
00:10:16,580 --> 00:10:19,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">So I got this cloth newly made along
with my new threads!</font>

106
00:10:20,050 --> 00:10:24,650
<font color="#FFFFFF">But thanks to that intense training,
you've gotten quite strong, haven't you?</font>

107
00:10:25,250 --> 00:10:26,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">You should be happy about it.</font>

108
00:10:26,750 --> 00:10:28,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. I feel like I've gotten
another step closer</font>

109
00:10:28,950 --> 00:10:31,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">to becoming the Hokage!</font>

110
00:10:31,450 --> 00:10:34,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ooh, sounds like you've got
quite the confidence!</font>

111
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:36,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah! Speaking of which,</font>

112
00:10:36,180 --> 00:10:39,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">I heard Gaara of the Hidden Sand
has already become the Kazekage!</font>

113
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:44,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh... That kid's kind of special, so.</font>

114
00:10:45,750 --> 00:10:48,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">What do you mean by special?</font>

115
00:10:48,650 --> 00:10:49,580
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh?</font>

116
00:10:50,420 --> 00:10:53,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">You don't become the Kazekage
just by being special.</font>

117
00:10:55,580 --> 00:10:57,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can tell...</font>

118
00:10:57,780 --> 00:11:01,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">I bet... he worked incredibly hard...</font>

119
00:11:02,580 --> 00:11:06,550
<font color="#FFFFFF">He worked really hard,
everyone acknowledged him...</font>

120
00:11:07,650 --> 00:11:09,880
<font color="#FFFFFF">and then he became the Kazekage!</font>

121
00:11:26,180 --> 00:11:28,420
<font color="#FFFFFF">What the hell happened...?</font>

122
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:30,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">G-Gaara...</font>

123
00:11:42,280 --> 00:11:43,650
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara!</font>

124
00:11:49,150 --> 00:11:50,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lady Tsunade.</font>

125
00:11:50,820 --> 00:11:54,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">Have you decided on
the first mission for Team Kakashi?</font>

126
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:57,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto and Sakura did
nothing but training</font>

127
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:59,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">for two and a half years, after all.</font>

128
00:11:59,880 --> 00:12:02,880
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm going to have them work off
those two and a half years!</font>

129
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:05,250
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, how about something like this...?</font>

130
00:12:05,650 --> 00:12:07,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">A VIP escort in the Land of Rice Paddies...</font>

131
00:12:08,450 --> 00:12:09,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is a B-rank mission, huh...?</font>

132
00:12:11,020 --> 00:12:14,650
<font color="#FFFFFF">But Naruto hasn't been on
a mission in quite awhile.</font>

133
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:17,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wouldn't an easier mission
be better to start...?</font>

134
00:12:19,180 --> 00:12:20,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">Look, how about something like this...?</font>

135
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:24,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dog-walking...?</font>

136
00:12:24,850 --> 00:12:26,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is a D-rank mission!</font>

137
00:12:26,880 --> 00:12:28,420
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sakura's a Chunin,</font>

138
00:12:28,450 --> 00:12:30,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">and I'm sure Naruto is
much stronger now.</font>

139
00:12:30,350 --> 00:12:32,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't send them on
a mission like this!</font>

140
00:12:32,420 --> 00:12:35,480
<font color="#FFFFFF">However... there's the issue with
the Nine-Tails to consider.</font>

141
00:12:35,520 --> 00:12:38,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't think it's wise to imprudently
send him out of the village too much...</font>

142
00:12:38,380 --> 00:12:40,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's why I teamed them up
with Kakashi.</font>

143
00:12:41,250 --> 00:12:43,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">I... understand that, but...</font>

144
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:45,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">We can at least give them
this mission.</font>

145
00:12:45,720 --> 00:12:46,980
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll concede no further.</font>

146
00:12:48,550 --> 00:12:52,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">A gold bullion transport convoy...
A C-rank mission...?</font>

147
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:57,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto will probably still get miffed.
He'll say it's too easy.</font>

148
00:12:58,180 --> 00:12:59,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ichiraku Ramen</font>

149
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:05,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh!</font>

150
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:08,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sorry about that, old man!</font>

151
00:13:08,420 --> 00:13:09,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't worry about it.</font>

152
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:12,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">Man, what a waste.</font>

153
00:13:24,280 --> 00:13:25,480
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lord Kazekage!</font>

154
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:29,780
<font color="#FFFFFF">It-It can't be! Gaara's Ultimate Defense
has been...</font>

155
00:13:30,280 --> 00:13:31,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">What the hell did he do...?</font>

156
00:13:46,880 --> 00:13:49,380
<font color="#FFFFFF">I cause an explosion
at point-blank range...</font>

157
00:13:49,980 --> 00:13:52,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">and you're forced to use</font>

158
00:13:52,180 --> 00:13:56,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">your speedy gourd sand you crushed
my hand with to defend yourself...</font>

159
00:13:56,780 --> 00:14:00,080
<font color="#FFFFFF">However...
then I'm down to my last attack...</font>

160
00:14:00,220 --> 00:14:02,280
<font color="#FFFFFF">I had to create an opening</font>

161
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:06,880
<font color="#FFFFFF">in order to cause a sure explosion
at close range...</font>

162
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:12,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">I dropped my "specialty..."
on the village for that very purpose.</font>

163
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:42,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">I guess I'll go retrieve him.</font>

164
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:13,480
<font color="#FFFFFF">I get it.</font>

165
00:15:14,450 --> 00:15:15,880
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wh-What's happening...?</font>

166
00:15:16,650 --> 00:15:18,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's draining his last remaining strength</font>

167
00:15:18,880 --> 00:15:21,780
<font color="#FFFFFF">in an attempt to move the sand
outside the village...</font>

168
00:15:22,580 --> 00:15:24,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">He wants to make sure the village
isn't damaged!</font>

169
00:15:26,180 --> 00:15:28,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'd expect no less from the Kazekage...</font>

170
00:15:28,750 --> 00:15:31,950
<font color="#FFFFFF">Even when it'd be easier just to
drop it on the village.</font>

171
00:15:38,850 --> 00:15:40,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">G-Gaara...</font>

172
00:15:41,250 --> 00:15:45,080
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, what're you guys doing?
We must protect Lord Kazekage!</font>

173
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:46,550
<font color="#FFFFFF">Commence attack!</font>

174
00:15:47,150 --> 00:15:48,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!</font>

175
00:15:52,150 --> 00:15:53,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">Fire!</font>

176
00:16:04,550 --> 00:16:06,280
<font color="#FFFFFF">Your attacks are futile.</font>

177
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:08,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Fire!</font>

178
00:16:10,950 --> 00:16:13,280
<font color="#FFFFFF">Your attacks are futile, I'm telling you!</font>

179
00:16:24,380 --> 00:16:26,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">They got a bit creative, huh...?</font>

180
00:16:31,820 --> 00:16:36,280
<font color="#FFFFFF">My man Sasori will be ticked off if
I keep him waiting too long.</font>

181
00:16:43,750 --> 00:16:46,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">Is he going to keep me waiting forever?</font>

182
00:17:02,950 --> 00:17:05,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hang in there, Lord Kazekage!</font>

183
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:25,080
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara! Hang in there just a little longer!</font>

184
00:17:47,120 --> 00:17:48,080
<font color="#FFFFFF">He did it!</font>

185
00:18:07,720 --> 00:18:10,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now it's your turn
to work hard, Naruto.</font>

186
00:18:11,920 --> 00:18:13,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">But my opposition's the Kazekage...</font>

187
00:18:14,450 --> 00:18:16,950
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm still just a Genin...</font>

188
00:18:17,550 --> 00:18:21,420
<font color="#FFFFFF">But your training with Master Jiraiya
wasn't for nothing, right?</font>

189
00:18:22,080 --> 00:18:28,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">I heard you and Sakura were able
to take the bells away from Kakashi.</font>

190
00:18:29,220 --> 00:18:31,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">It was more of a cinch than I thought!</font>

191
00:18:31,620 --> 00:18:35,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">I might even be stronger
than you, Iruka Sensei!</font>

192
00:18:35,050 --> 00:18:36,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">What're you talking about?</font>

193
00:18:36,650 --> 00:18:38,980
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm a long way from being outdone!</font>

194
00:18:39,220 --> 00:18:41,980
<font color="#FFFFFF">We won't know unless we try!</font>

195
00:18:42,480 --> 00:18:43,550
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, come on!</font>

196
00:18:44,380 --> 00:18:46,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">In any event, starting tomorrow,</font>

197
00:18:46,780 --> 00:18:49,250
<font color="#FFFFFF">you'll be working as a member
of Team Kakashi, right?</font>

198
00:18:49,420 --> 00:18:50,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">Good luck!</font>

199
00:18:52,420 --> 00:18:53,420
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right!</font>

200
00:18:54,550 --> 00:18:57,420
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm going to become Hokage
in the future, after all...</font>

201
00:18:57,880 --> 00:19:00,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">No way will I be outdone by
the likes of Gaara!</font>

202
00:19:04,150 --> 00:19:05,080
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara!</font>

203
00:19:05,680 --> 00:19:07,420
<font color="#FFFFFF">Rescue Lord Kazekage!</font>

204
00:19:13,950 --> 00:19:18,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">It was harder than
I thought not to kill him...</font>

205
00:19:44,580 --> 00:19:46,650
<font color="#FFFFFF">Mission cleared.</font>

206
00:19:56,050 --> 00:19:57,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara!</font>

207
00:21:35,720 --> 00:21:39,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">Here is the latest forecast from
today's weather report.</font>

208
00:21:39,550 --> 00:21:42,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">Mostly clear skies in
the Hidden Sand Village.</font>

209
00:21:42,380 --> 00:21:45,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">However, certain areas may expect
showers of various colored sands.</font>

210
00:21:45,380 --> 00:21:50,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">There are also chances of sudden falls
of detonation clay similar to last night.</font>

211
00:21:50,150 --> 00:21:52,480
<font color="#FFFFFF">Please be careful
when going outdoors.</font>

212
00:21:52,720 --> 00:21:56,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">It is recommended for well-used Puppets
to be placed within Scrolls.</font>

213
00:21:57,080 --> 00:22:00,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">That was the forecast report form
the Hidden Sand Weather Station.</font>

214
